    "updated_at": "2026-03-17T06:45:15Z",
    "body": "IMO \"duration-like object\" should mean an object with properties `years`, `minutes`, etc. since existing APIs (`Intl.DurationFormat.p.format` and `Temporal.Duration.from`) accept such object.\n\nBrowsers can convert a duration-like object to real `Temporal.Duration` via `Temporal.Duration.from` and then convert to milliseconds via `total` method.",
